<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - K N Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - K N Energy raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Friday it had raised its near-term rating for K N Energy Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The Lakewood, Colo., natural gas supplier kept its long-term rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 37-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
